From 8ed1ceae53b95180b4b3f050d59c51d83507fbdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:30:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(auth): add mobile refresh sessions alongside web
 sessions

Allow one web and one mobile session per account: a sign-in now
replaces only the same client's session instead of bumping
auth_version. Student and Faculty phones (client=mobile) get a 30-day
refresh key, stored as an HMAC and rotated on every use with reuse
detection. Add /auth/refresh and /auth/logout, migration 037 and
login-security service tests.
